---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Latest Jobs & Internships in India | GetJobCareer"
  description="Find the latest jobs, internships and career opportunities in India. Search jobs for BCA, MCA, B.Tech, B.Sc IT, M.Sc IT and Computer Science students and freshers on GetJobCareer."
>
  <main class="jobs-page">
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="jobs-header">
      <div class="container hero-container">
        <span class="badge">Career Opportunities</span>

        <h1>Latest Jobs & Internships in India</h1>

       <p class="hero-description">
  Find the latest jobs, internships and career opportunities for
  <span class="highlight-keyword">BCA</span>,
  <span class="highlight-keyword">MCA</span>,
  <span class="highlight-keyword">B.Tech</span>,
  <span class="highlight-keyword">B.Sc IT</span>,
  <span class="highlight-keyword">M.Sc IT</span>,
  <span class="highlight-keyword">B.Sc Computer Science</span> and
  <span class="highlight-keyword">M.Sc Computer Science</span>
  students, freshers and graduates across India.
</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SEARCH -->
    <section class="search-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="search-box">
          <div class="search-field search-field-large">
            <span class="field-icon">⌕</span>

            <input
              id="searchInput"
              type="text"
              placeholder="Search job title or company..."
            />
          </div>

          <div class="select-wrapper">
            <select id="categoryFilter">
              <option value="">All Categories</option>
            </select>
            <span class="select-arrow">⌄</span>
          </div>

          <div class="select-wrapper">
            <select id="jobTypeFilter">
              <option value="">All Job Types</option>
            </select>
            <span class="select-arrow">⌄</span>
          </div>

          <div class="select-wrapper">
            <select id="workModeFilter">
              <option value="">All Work Modes</option>
            </select>
            <span class="select-arrow">⌄</span>
          </div>

          <div class="search-field">
            <span class="field-icon location-icon">⌖</span>

            <input
              id="locationFilter"
              type="text"
              placeholder="Location"
            />
          </div>

          <button id="searchButton" class="search-button">
            Search
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- RESULTS -->
    <section class="results-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="results-top">
          <div>
            <h2>Latest Jobs</h2>
            <p>Explore the latest opportunities</p>
          </div>

          <span id="resultCount">Loading jobs...</span>
        </div>

        <div id="loading" class="loading">
          <div class="spinner"></div>
          <span>Loading jobs...</span>
        </div>

        <div id="errorMessage" class="error-message hidden"></div>

        <div id="jobsContainer" class="jobs-grid"></div>

        <div id="emptyMessage" class="empty-message hidden">
          <div class="empty-icon">⌕</div>
          <h3>No jobs found</h3>
          <p>Try changing your search or filters.</p>
        </div>

        <div id="pagination" class="pagination"></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

   <!-- =========================
     FAQ SECTION
========================= -->

<section class="faq-section" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="faq-container">

    <div class="faq-heading">
      <span class="faq-badge">Frequently Asked Questions</span>

      <h2 id="faq-heading">
        Frequently Asked Questions About GetJobCareer
      </h2>

      <p>
        Find answers to common questions about jobs, internships,
        career opportunities and job searches on GetJobCareer.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-list">

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>
          What is GetJobCareer?
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            GetJobCareer is a job and career platform that helps students,
            freshers and job seekers discover the latest jobs, internships
            and career opportunities. You can search for opportunities by
            job title, company, category, location, job type and work mode.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>
          Can BCA students find jobs on GetJobCareer?
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            Yes. GetJobCareer can help BCA students and BCA freshers discover
            relevant jobs, internships and entry-level career opportunities.
            Students can search for software development, web development,
            IT support, testing, digital marketing and other suitable roles.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>
          Are there jobs for MCA students and freshers?
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            Yes. MCA students and freshers can use GetJobCareer to find
            technology jobs and internships. Opportunities may include
            software development, full stack development, backend development,
            frontend development, database, testing and other IT roles.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>
          Can B.Tech students find jobs and internships here?
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            Yes. GetJobCareer provides a place to discover job and internship
            opportunities suitable for B.Tech graduates and students.
            Depending on available listings, candidates can explore software,
            IT, engineering and other technology-related career opportunities.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>
          Are there jobs for B.Sc IT and M.Sc IT graduates?
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            Yes. B.Sc IT and M.Sc IT students and graduates can use
            GetJobCareer to search for relevant IT jobs and internships.
            You can explore opportunities based on your skills, experience,
            location, job type and work mode.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>
          Does GetJobCareer have jobs for Computer Science students?
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            GetJobCareer can help Computer Science students and graduates
            discover relevant career opportunities. Candidates with B.Sc
            Computer Science, M.Sc Computer Science and related qualifications
            can search available software, IT and technology jobs and
            internships.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>
          Can freshers find jobs on GetJobCareer?
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            Yes. Freshers can use GetJobCareer to search for entry-level jobs,
            internships and graduate opportunities. You can use job search
            filters to find opportunities based on your preferred category,
            location, job type and work mode.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>
          What types of jobs can I search for on GetJobCareer?
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            The available jobs depend on current listings. You may find
            opportunities in software development, web development, frontend,
            backend, full stack development, IT, testing, digital marketing,
            data-related roles, internships and other career categories.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>
          Can I search jobs by location and work mode?
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            Yes. GetJobCareer allows job seekers to search and filter
            opportunities using information such as location, job type and
            work mode. This can help candidates find opportunities that better
            match their preferred working location and working arrangement.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>
          Does GetJobCareer list internships for students?
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            Yes. Students and freshers can use GetJobCareer to discover
            internship opportunities along with available job listings.
            Internships can be useful for gaining practical experience,
            developing skills and starting a professional career.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>
          How can I find the latest jobs on GetJobCareer?
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            Visit the Jobs & Internships section of GetJobCareer and use the
            available search and filters. You can search by job title or
            company and narrow results using category, job type, work mode
            and location.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>
          Is GetJobCareer useful for Indian job seekers?
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </summary>

        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            GetJobCareer is designed to make job discovery easier for students,
            freshers and job seekers looking for career opportunities. Users
            can explore available job listings and internships and use search
            filters to find opportunities that match their career interests.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>


